### Start reservation
PATCH {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/9/start
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}

### Get reservation after start

GET {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/9
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}

### Complete reservation

PATCH {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/9/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}

### Invalid transition - start completed reservation

PATCH {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/9/start
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}

### Cancel pending reservation

PATCH {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/10/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}

### Get cancelled reservation

GET {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}

